    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "img": null,
      "text": "Nayokaki penza, penza, penza, mawa. Biso nionso tobandaki kolela. Koko ya mwasi azaki malamu na biso, tango moto mokote alakisaki biso bolamu.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.africanstorybook.org/newviewer/index.php?bt=3&dual=false&id=33812#page=5",
      "sourceDigest": "sha256:381c88c1d0625089f3a1951a0c6fce7ccecc7f37421b90d86abb30104a088cb0"
